questions.question_text:
The column graph shows the Richter magnitude of four earthquakes.
How many times greater was the ground amplitude at Tonga than at Alaska?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.7]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,9.4);
\draw[->] (0,0)--(11,0);
\foreach \y in {1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8} {\draw (-0.2,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.2,\y) {$\y$};}
\node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.2,0) {$0$};
\draw (0.8,0) rectangle (2.3,6);
\draw (3.1,0) rectangle (4.6,4);
\draw (5.4,0) rectangle (6.9,5);
\draw (7.7,0) rectangle (9.2,2);
\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (1.55,0) {Tonga};
\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (3.85,0) {Alaska};
\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (6.15,0) {Iran};
\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (8.45,0) {Crete};
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.4,4.5) {Magnitude};
\node[below] at (5.0,-1.0) {Earthquake};
\node at (5.0,9.1) {Richter magnitudes};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
